{"id":"4dc3650ade643e92","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HConseq.md","title":"HConseq","display":"HConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"HConseq","parameters":["g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"HConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Heyting 代数语义。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ HConseq g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FormsH g)\n  (and\n    (@ FmH a)\n    (forall D\n      (forall R\n        (forall m\n          (forall j\n            (forall h\n              (forall z\n                (forall o\n                  (forall v\n                    (implies\n                      (and\n                        (@ HeytingAlgebra D R m j h z o)\n                        (and\n                          (exists w (and (@ Omega w) (@ Map v w D)))\n                          (forall b (implies (in b g) (@ HSat D R m j h z o v b)))))\n                      (@ HSat D R m j h z o v a))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b08bd71c708a439\" href=\"?note=8b08bd71c708a439\" title=\"ZFC_FmH\">FmH</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8cdac84dcb4b3212\" href=\"?note=8cdac84dcb4b3212\" title=\"ZFC_FormsH\">FormsH</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06ea58c3b2d480a5\" href=\"?note=06ea58c3b2d480a5\" title=\"ZFC_HSat\">HSat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"23fc3019079f617c\" href=\"?note=23fc3019079f617c\" title=\"ZFC_HeytingAlgebra\">HeytingAlgebra</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ HConseq g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmH","status":"resolved","id":"8b08bd71c708a439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmH|FmH]]；[[ZFC_FormsH|FormsH]]；[[ZFC_HSat|HSat]]；[[ZFC_HeytingAlgebra|HeytingAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FormsH","status":"resolved","id":"8cdac84dcb4b3212","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmH|FmH]]；[[ZFC_FormsH|FormsH]]；[[ZFC_HSat|HSat]]；[[ZFC_HeytingAlgebra|HeytingAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_HSat","status":"resolved","id":"06ea58c3b2d480a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmH|FmH]]；[[ZFC_FormsH|FormsH]]；[[ZFC_HSat|HSat]]；[[ZFC_HeytingAlgebra|HeytingAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_HeytingAlgebra","status":"resolved","id":"23fc30190